# Lo and Li, Twin Tutors: "When Lo and Li enter, search your library for a Lesson or Noble card, reveal it, put it into your hand,
# then shuffle." Bot1's library holds a Noble (Mai, Scornful Striker), a Lesson (Ozai's Cruelty) and Swamps; the Swamp is no find
# (the refusal) and Mai is taken. Bot2's hand and library hold a Mai and an Ozai's Cruelty too, and they stay where they are: a
# search is of the searcher's own library and goes to their own hand. "Noble creatures you control ... have lifelink": on turn 5 Mai
# and Lo and Li (a Human Advisor, not a Noble) both attack Bot2's empty board for 2 each, and Bot1 gains 2, Mai's alone (22).

